  "prefLabel": "Jus 1508.04 Manner of Transmission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1508.04 Manner of Transmission. The demand shall be transmitted to the communications common carrier by any one or more of the following means, consistent with Jus 1508.01 through 1508.03:\n\n(a) In person;\n\n(b) By first class mail;\n\n(c) By electronic facsimile transmission; or\n\n(d) By other electronic means.\n\nSource. #8082, eff 5-8-04",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus1500.html"
